      "confidence": "high",
      "passed": true,
      "latency_s": 3.0220372999999654,
      "answer_text": "In encoder-decoder attention, the **queries come from the previous decoder layer**, and the **keys and values come from the output of the encoder** (Applications of attention in our model). This setup allows every position in the decoder to attend over all positions in the input sequence, mimicking typical encoder-decoder attention mechanisms in sequence-to-sequence models.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "section": "applications of attention in our model",
          "chunk_id": "1706.03762v7_applications of attention in our model_0"
