      "answer_text": "For English constituency parsing, the authors used a **4-layer Transformer with dmodel = 1024** (stated in the \"English constituency parsing\" section). \n\n- In the **WSJ-only setting**, they achieved an **F1 score of 91.3** (stated in the \"English constituency parsing\" section, Table 4).  \n- In the **semi-supervised setting**, they achieved an **F1 score of 92.7** (stated in the \"English constituency parsing\" section, Table 4).  \n\nBoth results are measured on Section 23 of the WSJ portion of the Penn Treebank, and the F1 scores are reported as measured by the authors.",
